Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.26,0:02:58.17,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}始终追寻着那日所见的风景
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.55,0:03:03.18,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}可只是一味追赶 却怎么也追不上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.73,0:03:06.38,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}哪怕挑战数千回
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.67,0:03:09.09,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}哪怕失败数万次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.09,0:03:13.89,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}几乎要放弃一切时
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.05,0:03:17.70,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}那无法言喻的心脏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.70,0:03:20.36,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}却在呐喊「还能继续努力」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.36,0:03:24.65,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}于是再次坚定地许下心愿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.23,0:03:27.86,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}即便如此 也要继续战斗
